WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,620 --> 00:00:01,620
what did you say

2
00:00:01,620 --> 00:00:06,260
You said you wanted to train troops, right?

3
00:00:06,260 --> 00:00:07,260
Zhang Meng and others want to become stronger

4
00:00:07,260 --> 00:00:09,260
As a superior, I naturally want to satisfy them

5
00:00:09,260 --> 00:00:10,260
they become stronger

6
00:00:10,260 --> 00:00:16,030
It can be considered that I have become stronger.

7
00:00:16,030 --> 00:00:18,030
Those thorny heads of Zhang Meng can listen to you

8
00:00:18,030 --> 00:00:19,930
They're pretty good

9
00:00:19,930 --> 00:00:20,930
What method do you want to use

10
00:00:20,930 --> 00:00:21,930
help them become stronger

11
00:00:21,930 --> 00:00:22,930
don't tell me

12
00:00:22,930 --> 00:00:23,930
What kind of exercise is it?

13
00:00:23,930 --> 00:00:25,930
These ordinary soldiers

14
00:00:25,930 --> 00:00:26,930
The most basic exercises in the military camp

15
00:00:26,930 --> 00:00:27,930
I can’t even understand it

16
00:00:27,930 --> 00:00:28,930
No matter how powerful you give them

17
00:00:28,930 --> 00:00:29,930
It’s useless even if you give me the exercises

18
00:00:29,930 --> 00:00:30,930
Not a Kung Fu

19
00:00:30,930 --> 00:00:32,930
It's a training method

20
00:00:32,930 --> 00:00:34,660
Exercise method

21
00:00:34,660 --> 00:00:36,660
Family practice exercises

22
00:00:36,660 --> 00:00:37,660
It seems

23
00:00:37,660 --> 00:00:39,660
You kid is not simple

24
00:00:39,660 --> 00:00:41,660
So what do you mean by coming to me this time?

25
00:00:41,660 --> 00:00:42,860
Training?

26
00:00:42,860 --> 00:00:44,860
Although it is not as good as training warriors

27
00:00:44,860 --> 00:00:46,860
But we still need some resources

28
00:00:46,860 --> 00:00:47,860
You kid, what you say means nothing.

29
00:00:47,860 --> 00:00:50,980
You just want money, right?

30
00:00:50,980 --> 00:00:52,980
Then tell me whether to give it or not.
